ics_inner` (lines 920-925), these new semantics are also added to `shared_existing`.\r\n    *   The `SemanticChunkExtractor` is now correctly passed a clone of this `shared_existing` mutex.\r\n    These changes collectively ensure that the `LookupKgTool` has a complete view of all previously extracted and checkpointed semantics, which is crucial for its correctness and addresses audit finding F8.\r\n\r\n3.  **`graph_ordered_body` Path Ranking (F7):** The `rank` closure within `graph_ordered_body` has been refined. It now prioritizes an exact path match before falling back to a slash-bounded suffix match. This fixes an issue where a shorter, more general path (e.g., \"a.sol\") could incorrectly rank a more specific path (e.g., \"vendor/a.sol\"), as described in audit finding F7.\r\n\r\nAll identified changes are fixes for known issues and appear to be correctly implemented. No new defects are introduced by this change.\r\n\r\nVERDICT: CLEAR"
